# Supabase — create a project at https://supabase.com, then paste the values
# from Project Settings › API. Without these the app runs local-only: no
# sign-in, no sync, no counter. Copy to .env.local for development and add
# the same two variables to the Vercel project for production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
